                                "sense_id": "06d9d4fd-a53c-3987-a62c-5618d7fc25a7",
                                "text": "[…]the mouth is formed by a rather strong tooth over a denticulate margin, confronting what may be called the upper jaw,"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1a75f528-9bf4-4424-91f2-2f0f2ec73df8",
                                "sense_id": "06d9d4fd-a53c-3987-a62c-5618d7fc25a7",
                                "text": "Selaginella tarda differs from S. sertata in that the plants are smaller and lacking flagelliform shoots, the leaves are denticulate, and the median leaves are not peltate."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ae68952e-d3d1-3a3b-91f7-953049e3f354",
                        "entry_id": "6eecb880-4b94-301b-a81c-dbf055e26891",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Having dentils or denticules."
