                                "sense_id": "ae68952e-d3d1-3a3b-91f7-953049e3f354",
                                "text": "Each is embellished with Italian Renaissance-inspired detail, including rusticated stonework, pedimented window hoods, consoles, cartouches, a denticulate cornice and a roof-mounted balustrade"
